<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Herdez raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Herdez raised.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming Research on Thursday said it raised its rating on Mexican food company Grupo Herdez to buy from hold.</p>
<p>The stock last traded on April 16 at 3.07 pesos.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau, 525 728-7982))</p>
